<title>SINGAPORE: SIA unit, Pratt &amp; Whitney in JV.</title>
<headline>SIA unit, Pratt &amp; Whitney in JV.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Airlines Ltd's (SIA) engineering unit and Pratt &amp; Whitney (P&amp;W) have formed a joint venture to overhaul and repair JT9D, PW4000 and CFM56 engines in Singapore, SIA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>P&amp;W, a unit of United Technologies of the United States, will own 51 percent of the venture, it said.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
